{"strongs": "H4227", "word": "מַחֲבַת", "translit": "ma.cha.vat", "root": "חבת", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "flat plate, pan, or griddle for baking", "definition": "מַחֲבַת noun feminine flat plate, pan, or griddle for baking , only P and late; absolute ׳ מ Lev 2:5 + 2 t.; מַחֲבַ֑ת Lev 7:9 construct מַחֲבַת Ezek 4:3 — 1. used in preparing the (baken) mincha , preceded by עַלֿ Lev 2:5 ; Lev 6:14 ; Lev 7:9 (all P ), compare 1Chr 23:29 . 2. בַּרְזֶל ׳ מ Ezek 4:3 a plate of iron , signifying an iron wall, in prediction of siege of city. חָג , חָגָּא see below חגּגּ .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2533')\">BDB2533</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4227')\">H4227</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2532')\">BDB2532</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB2534')\">BDB2534</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מַחֲבַת</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>flat plate, pan, or griddle for baking</highlightword>, only <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> and late; absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>מ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 2:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,5)\">Lev 2:5</ref> + 2 t.; <bdbheb>מַחֲבַ֑ת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 7:9\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(3,7,9)\">Lev 7:9</ref> construct <bdbheb>מַחֲבַת</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ezek 4:3\" b=\"26\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(26,4,3)\">Ezek 4:3</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> used in preparing the (baken) <highlight>mincha</highlight>, preceded by <bdbheb>עַלֿ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Lev 2:5\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"2\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"2\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(3,2,5)\">Lev 2:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 6:14\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(3,6,14)\">Lev 6:14</ref>; <ref ref=\"Lev 7:9\" b=\"3\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"9\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"9\" onclick=\"bcv(3,7,9)\">